  "details": "# Issue:\nWhen moving your head in VR you can see the IK of others in the lobby kicking back in. People will fly up from the floor to where they actually are, you can see Phys Bones wiggling a lot from the the IK snapping back in etc.\n# Attachments:\nHere are two videos showcasing the issues:   \nhttps://streamable.com/r5q95f  \nhttps://streamable.com/v2353l\nIt's relatively hard to see because FOV is smaller then what I see in the headset, but it should still be noticeable.",
